WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:04.120
Unfilial son you unfilial son.

00:05.160 --> 00:06.840
Unfilial son.

00:08.400 --> 00:10.800
I will absolutely not abdicate to you.

00:17.520 --> 00:18.920
Father.

00:20.120 --> 00:21.600
Don't force your son.

00:23.240 --> 00:28.587
You withdraw for now today I can still spare you.

00:31.360 --> 00:33.027
Then don't blame your son.

00:36.920 --> 00:38.600
For all under heaven.

00:39.640 --> 00:41.320
For the people's peace.

00:44.320 --> 00:47.680
I Sikong Sheng.

00:48.640 --> 00:51.120
Am willing to be an unfilial descendant.

00:53.600 --> 00:59.440
The 22nd year of Longwu the court announced to all Emperor Sikong Yao died of serious illness.

00:59.520 --> 01:04.160
Crown Prince Sikong Sheng announced his succession but not long after.

01:04.240 --> 01:10.000
Second Prince Sikong Xu raised troops, claiming Sikong Sheng forced the late emperor's death and usurped the throne.

01:10.080 --> 01:12.280
Xuan Kingdom fell into civil war again.

01:13.120 --> 01:18.920
The same year shilang took advantage of the Sikong royal family's internal strife marched south.

01:20.000 --> 01:31.000
The aristocratic clans launched a concerted counterattack, assassinating several key war commanders. Left leaderless, the army collapsed without a battle.

